WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:09.969
&gt;&gt;&gt; Actor Danny Masterson, best

00:00:10.102 --> 00:00:15.975
known for his role on "That '70s

00:00:16.108 --> 00:00:16.976
show" was sentenced to 30 years

00:00:16.976 --> 00:00:19.211
to life in prison for raping two

00:00:19.378 --> 00:00:21.013
women in the early 2000s.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.982
It was the maximum sentence the

00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:24.316
court could give for the crimes.

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:27.620
More from CNN correspondent

00:00:27.987 --> 00:00:28.120
Stephanie elam.

00:00:28.287 --> 00:00:29.989
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Danny Masterson was

00:00:29.989 --> 00:00:31.991
sentenced to 15 years for each

00:00:31.991 --> 00:00:33.993
count of rape that he was found

00:00:34.126 --> 00:00:35.528
guilty of in may, so that is

00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:37.997
expected to be served

00:00:37.997 --> 00:00:38.998
consecutively according to the

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:41.634
judge, so 30 years to life for

00:00:42.001 --> 00:00:43.002
Masterson, and really a huge

00:00:43.035 --> 00:00:45.004
part of this because of the two

00:00:45.137 --> 00:00:47.006
named victims that came forward

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:49.241
and also spoke in court.

00:00:49.341 --> 00:00:53.012
In fact, take a listen to the

00:00:53.145 --> 00:00:55.014
assistant district attorney

00:00:55.147 --> 00:00:55.548
speaking about this.

00:00:56.015 --> 00:00:58.017
&gt;&gt; I'm very happy for the

00:00:58.017 --> 00:00:58.450
victims because this is a day

00:00:58.551 --> 00:01:00.052
they had been looking forward to

00:01:00.152 --> 00:01:02.021
and justice was a long time

00:01:02.021 --> 00:01:03.022
coming.

00:01:03.022 --> 00:01:05.057
That's first and foremost.

00:01:05.224 --> 00:01:07.126
But, also, being very thankful

00:01:07.259 --> 00:01:11.030
for the jury to kind of see

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:12.031
through everything and recognize

00:01:12.064 --> 00:01:13.432
what the evidence is and that

00:01:13.566 --> 00:01:15.234
this defendant needed to be held

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:16.368
accountable.

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:18.537
&gt;&gt; Masterson had pled not guilty

00:01:18.671 --> 00:01:20.072
to raping these women in his

00:01:20.239 --> 00:01:23.342
home in incidents between 2001

00:01:23.475 --> 00:01:25.044
and 2003.

00:01:25.177 --> 00:01:28.047
His lawyer also spoke after

00:01:28.047 --> 00:01:29.582
sentencing, and this is what she

00:01:29.682 --> 00:01:30.049
had to say.

00:01:30.082 --> 00:01:33.052
&gt;&gt; Mr. Masterson did not commit

00:01:33.052 --> 00:01:35.054
the crimes for which he has been

00:01:35.054 --> 00:01:36.288
convicted and we and the

00:01:36.455 --> 00:01:37.256
appellate lawyers, who are the

00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:39.091
best and the brightest in the

00:01:39.191 --> 00:01:40.659
country, are confident that

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:43.062
these convictions will be

00:01:43.095 --> 00:01:43.395
overturned.

00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:45.064
&gt;&gt; Reporter: The assistant

00:01:45.064 --> 00:01:46.165
district attorney Mueller did

00:01:46.298 --> 00:01:47.499
say that they have no intention

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:51.070
of going back and reprosecuting

00:01:51.103 --> 00:01:53.205
that third rape charge against

00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:55.407
Masterson, which the jury was

00:01:55.507 --> 00:01:56.675
deadlocked on.

00:01:57.076 --> 00:01:58.077
He says they're satisfied with

00:01:58.077 --> 00:01:59.111
these two counts and are moving

00:01:59.278 --> 00:02:00.079
forward with that.

00:02:00.179 --> 00:02:02.081
It's also worth noting that

00:02:02.081 --> 00:02:04.116
Danny Masterson is a well-known

00:02:04.283 --> 00:02:06.085
scientologist and the church of

00:02:06.118 --> 00:02:07.720
scientology was invoked in this

00:02:08.087 --> 00:02:09.588
trial, and what role they may

00:02:09.722 --> 00:02:12.091
have played in this case.

00:02:12.124 --> 00:02:13.525
However, we reached back out to

00:02:13.692 --> 00:02:15.094
the church and they referred us

00:02:15.227 --> 00:02:17.096
back to the statement thathey

00:02:17.129 --> 00:02:19.531
originally sent out on may 31st

00:02:19.698 --> 00:02:21.634
of this year, which says, in

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:24.103
part, there is not a scintilla

00:02:24.103 --> 00:02:25.137
of evidence supporting the

00:02:25.304 --> 00:02:26.438
scandalous allegations that the

00:02:26.605 --> 00:02:29.108
church harassed the accusers.

00:02:29.108 --> 00:02:30.342
Every single instance of

00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:31.543
supposed harassment of the

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.246
church is false and has been

00:02:34.346 --> 00:02:35.114
debunked.

00:02:35.247 --> 00:02:37.149
Stephanie elam, CNN, los

00:02:37.249 --> 00:02:37.449
Angeles.

00:02:37.616 --> 00:02:39.718
&gt;&gt;&gt; News of the allegations date

00:02:40.119 --> 00:02:41.720
back to March 2017 when

00:02:42.121 --> 00:02:44.123
journalist and former village

00:02:44.123 --> 00:02:46.325
voice editor, Tony Ortega, wrote

00:02:46.492 --> 00:02:48.227
on his site that Masterson was

00:02:48.327 --> 00:02:50.429
being investigated by the los

00:02:50.529 --> 00:02:52.131
Angeles police department, and

00:02:52.131 --> 00:02:53.232
Tony Ortega is joining us right

00:02:53.399 --> 00:02:55.134
now to discuss this.

00:02:55.134 --> 00:02:57.136
So you've reported on this case

00:02:57.302 --> 00:02:58.137
for years.

00:02:58.237 --> 00:03:00.372
Your reaction to this sentence?

00:03:00.539 --> 00:03:02.141
&gt;&gt; Well, it was a long time

00:03:02.241 --> 00:03:03.142
coming for these women.

00:03:03.142 --> 00:03:04.343
The reason why I broke that

00:03:04.476 --> 00:03:06.245
story in 2017 was I found out

00:03:06.378 --> 00:03:07.479
about the investigation and the

00:03:07.579 --> 00:03:10.149
LAPD was handling it very badly,

00:03:10.182 --> 00:03:11.483
and that these women were

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:12.685
panicked and they were afraid of

00:03:13.152 --> 00:03:14.653
the church of scientology's

00:03:14.787 --> 00:03:15.154
influence.

00:03:15.154 --> 00:03:16.255
That's really been a big story

00:03:16.388 --> 00:03:18.157
here, is how the church of

00:03:18.157 --> 00:03:19.491
scientology protected Danny

00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:21.260
Masterson for so long and

00:03:21.393 --> 00:03:22.594
punished these women for coming

00:03:22.761 --> 00:03:23.162
forward.

00:03:23.162 --> 00:03:25.230
So that's the story I sent out

00:03:25.397 --> 00:03:27.166
six years ago to see if these

00:03:27.199 --> 00:03:28.300
women would ever actually get

00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:29.568
their day in court.

00:03:29.702 --> 00:03:30.369
Boy, they did.

00:03:30.502 --> 00:03:32.404
They testified three times under

00:03:32.504 --> 00:03:33.706
oath, they were cross-examined

00:03:33.806 --> 00:03:34.506
each time.

00:03:34.606 --> 00:03:36.175
But this week they got to speak

00:03:36.308 --> 00:03:37.509
how they felt about things

00:03:37.676 --> 00:03:38.510
without being questioned.

00:03:38.677 --> 00:03:39.778
I think that was very important

00:03:40.179 --> 00:03:42.514
for them.

00:03:42.681 --> 00:03:45.184
&gt;&gt; And we saw in Stephanie

00:03:45.317 --> 00:03:46.485
elam's report, she had a portion

00:03:46.618 --> 00:03:48.187
of a statement from the church

00:03:48.187 --> 00:03:51.223
of scientology, and here is a

00:03:51.323 --> 00:03:53.192
little bit more from a statement

00:03:53.225 --> 00:03:55.427
they had published on may 31,

00:03:55.527 --> 00:03:57.429
that says there is not a

00:03:57.563 --> 00:03:58.530
scintilla of evidence supporting

00:03:58.697 --> 00:04:00.199
the scandalous allegations that

00:04:00.232 --> 00:04:02.201
the church harassed the

00:04:02.334 --> 00:04:02.634
accusers.

00:04:02.735 --> 00:04:04.436
The church has no policy

00:04:04.536 --> 00:04:05.704
prohibiting or discouraging

00:04:05.838 --> 00:04:07.740
members from reporting criminal

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:12.211
conduct of anyone.

00:04:12.244 --> 00:04:13.345
Scientologist or not to law

00:04:13.445 --> 00:04:13.746
enforcement.

00:04:13.846 --> 00:04:15.214
Quite the opposite.

00:04:15.347 --> 00:04:18.550
Church policy explicitly demands

00:04:18.684 --> 00:04:20.285
scientologists abide by all laws

00:04:20.385 --> 00:04:21.553
of the land.

00:04:21.687 --> 00:04:23.255
All allegations to the contrary

00:04:23.388 --> 00:04:24.356
are totally false.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:25.691
That a little more elaboration

00:04:25.791 --> 00:04:27.392
on a statement coming from the

00:04:27.493 --> 00:04:28.227
church of scientology.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.229
When you first started to report

00:04:30.295 --> 00:04:32.664
on this some six years ago, talk

00:04:32.798 --> 00:04:37.302
to me about what kind of

00:04:37.469 --> 00:04:38.237
obstacles you had in trying to

00:04:38.237 --> 00:04:39.805
get information, versions of

00:04:40.239 --> 00:04:40.372
events, et cetera.

00:04:40.506 --> 00:04:42.374
&gt;&gt; Well, right off the bat, two

00:04:42.508 --> 00:04:42.708
things.

00:04:42.808 --> 00:04:44.243
The first thing they say,

00:04:44.243 --> 00:04:46.311
there's no evidence about

00:04:46.411 --> 00:04:46.712
harassment.

00:04:46.812 --> 00:04:47.813
But they can say that now

00:04:48.247 --> 00:04:50.249
because the civil lawsuit about

00:04:50.315 --> 00:04:51.250
harassment hasn't progressed

00:04:51.316 --> 00:04:52.417
enough to where they can bring

00:04:52.518 --> 00:04:53.418
the evidence in.

00:04:54.319 --> 00:04:55.788
I personally know about evidence

00:04:55.921 --> 00:04:59.258
that showed the church of

00:04:59.391 --> 00:05:00.425
scientology has tried to detail

00:05:00.526 --> 00:05:01.527
this case and I expect it to

00:05:01.693 --> 00:05:02.628
come out during the civil

00:05:02.728 --> 00:05:03.262
lawsuit.

00:05:03.262 --> 00:05:04.263
The second thing they talk about

00:05:04.329 --> 00:05:06.265
is how there's no evidence of

00:05:06.265 --> 00:05:07.432
scientology discouraging anyone

00:05:07.533 --> 00:05:08.801
from going to police.

00:05:08.934 --> 00:05:10.803
They say this day in and day

00:05:10.936 --> 00:05:14.439
out, but during the case their

00:05:14.606 --> 00:05:17.276
own written testimonies were put

00:05:17.309 --> 00:05:18.844
into testimony showing that

00:05:19.278 --> 00:05:20.345
that's exactly what

00:05:20.446 --> 00:05:20.946
scientologists are told.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.549
So you have their written

00:05:23.715 --> 00:05:25.417
policies in court as testimony

00:05:25.551 --> 00:05:26.518
saying that scientologists

00:05:26.652 --> 00:05:27.753
cannot turn themselves in, and

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.354
then you have the spokesman

00:05:29.521 --> 00:05:32.858
saying we don't do that.

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:35.294
It's just a lie.

00:05:35.294 --> 00:05:37.296
Scientology lies, day in and day

00:05:37.296 --> 00:05:37.563
out.

00:05:37.729 --> 00:05:39.331
And that's what has made it so

00:05:39.465 --> 00:05:40.466
difficult for these women to get

00:05:40.632 --> 00:05:42.868
their day in court.

00:05:43.302 --> 00:05:45.537
But like deputy Mueller said,

00:05:45.671 --> 00:05:47.306
this court saw through this,

00:05:47.372 --> 00:05:49.308
this judge educated herself

00:05:49.308 --> 00:05:50.442
about scientology.

00:05:50.576 --> 00:05:51.944
I'm sure that's what the

00:05:52.311 --> 00:05:53.579
Masterson family will now focus

00:05:53.679 --> 00:05:55.647
their appeals on, the ruling

00:05:55.781 --> 00:05:58.684
about how much scientology she

00:05:58.851 --> 00:05:59.685
allowed into the case.

00:05:59.852 --> 00:06:02.321
&gt;&gt; And Masterson's defense

00:06:02.321 --> 00:06:02.955
attorneys did tell reporters

00:06:03.322 --> 00:06:06.992
they plan to appeal his

00:06:07.326 --> 00:06:07.392
convictions.

00:06:07.493 --> 00:06:09.394
Do you expect that they will be

00:06:09.495 --> 00:06:09.795
successful?

00:06:09.895 --> 00:06:11.330
&gt;&gt; Well, I know that they

00:06:11.363 --> 00:06:12.764
believe they have a lot to

00:06:12.898 --> 00:06:16.335
appeal on, because they will

00:06:16.335 --> 00:06:17.870
complain about the judge's

00:06:18.003 --> 00:06:19.404
rulings about how much

00:06:19.505 --> 00:06:20.939
scientology to allow in, they're

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:22.508
going to complain about the fact

00:06:22.608 --> 00:06:24.343
that there were a lot more

00:06:24.376 --> 00:06:25.811
references to drugging in the

00:06:25.944 --> 00:06:27.346
second trial than in the first

00:06:27.479 --> 00:06:27.613
trial.

00:06:27.779 --> 00:06:28.614
She also allowed in some

00:06:28.714 --> 00:06:29.882
testimony about harassment.

00:06:30.349 --> 00:06:31.350
I am positive all of those

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:34.353
things will come up on their

00:06:34.353 --> 00:06:35.521
appeal and they will argue these

00:06:35.654 --> 00:06:36.555
were mistakes by the judge.

00:06:36.722 --> 00:06:38.357
The appeal will focus more on

00:06:38.357 --> 00:06:40.526
the judge than on the victims.

00:06:40.659 --> 00:06:42.394
And I'm told that when there's a

00:06:42.561 --> 00:06:43.896
jury involved and the jury

00:06:43.996 --> 00:06:45.364
believes this evidence, that

00:06:45.464 --> 00:06:46.765
it's difficult for an appeals

00:06:46.899 --> 00:06:47.900
court to overturn that.

00:06:48.367 --> 00:06:49.701
But I'm sure the Masterson

00:06:49.801 --> 00:06:51.370
family is hoping they find a

00:06:51.503 --> 00:06:53.405
judge that will see it their

00:06:53.505 --> 00:06:54.406
way.

00:06:54.506 --> 00:06:58.577
&gt;&gt; Actors Ashton Kutcher and

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.712
mila Kunis were among dozens of

00:07:00.879 --> 00:07:02.014
celebrities that wrote letters

00:07:02.381 --> 00:07:04.416
in support of Masterson before

00:07:04.583 --> 00:07:06.718
sentencing.

00:07:06.885 --> 00:07:07.986
Was it at all impactful?

00:07:08.387 --> 00:07:08.921
&gt;&gt; I don't think so.

00:07:09.021 --> 00:07:10.822
I mean, the judge only had one

00:07:10.923 --> 00:07:12.391
choice to make, whether to give

00:07:12.391 --> 00:07:16.395
him 15 to life or 30 to life.

00:07:16.395 --> 00:07:17.629
And based on the testimony and

00:07:17.729 --> 00:07:18.830
the things sad said about

00:07:18.931 --> 00:07:20.499
the severity of the crime, I

00:07:20.632 --> 00:07:22.034
would have been shocked if she

00:07:22.401 --> 00:07:24.403
had allowed him to have only 15

00:07:24.403 --> 00:07:24.703
to life.

00:07:24.836 --> 00:07:26.405
But this is just a standard

00:07:26.405 --> 00:07:27.806
thing, the family and supporters

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.508
of the defendant will send in

00:07:29.641 --> 00:07:30.943
letters to try to sway the

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:32.410
judge.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:33.045
I got ahold of those letters

00:07:33.412 --> 00:07:34.646
yesterday and published them,

00:07:34.746 --> 00:07:36.448
and I think people were

00:07:36.548 --> 00:07:37.416
absolutely shocked to see the

00:07:37.516 --> 00:07:38.550
language in the letters from

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:42.454
people like Ashton Kutcher and

